	(text "LM75ADP U5  |  I2C address 0x48 (7-bit), A2:A0 = 000\nSDA GPIO18 / SCL GPIO19; R18/R19 = 4.7k to 3V3; initial 100 kHz.\nC18: VCC pin8. OS pin3 is NC; poll temperature over I2C.\nSupply current: 100 uA typical with inactive bus; 1 mA maximum with active bus.\nNXP LM75A register format: signed temperature; serialize per team protocol." (at 18 20 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ea273c94-6346-5ae6-8fe5-c7e37f6b1a65"))
)
